# API base URL. Optional — vite.config.ts defaults to http://localhost:3000 in
# development mode and https://klect.app in production mode, and the manifest's
# host_permissions are generated from whichever value wins, so the two can't drift.
#
# Only set this to point a build at something else (a Vercel preview deployment, say).
# A PRODUCTION build must never point at localhost: that permission is both a Chrome Web
# Store review flag and a real (if small) attack surface.
# VITE_API_URL=https://klect.app
